  clock: 5  # 721b
  nonce: 721b  # 721b
  set:  # 721b
    fields:  # 721b
      statement: "Within one function body, a receiver's type evidence must not be lost or replaced by an unrelated binding of the same bare name. RE-SCOPED 2026-10-25: the block-context recomputation defect is FIXED (7f3de7a4b6 threads _assigned down every recursion). LIVE: own-class field types are merged into the per-call type map under BARE names (py.py:7236-7241), so (a) a later local `conn = Other()` makes `self.conn.ping()` resolve to Other.ping @0.85 (wrong edge), and (b) a comprehension or lambda binding `conn` prunes the key (_prune_shadowed, py.py:4166) and `self.conn.ping()` drops to external @0.4 (lost edge). Also: var_types is pruned at a comprehension boundary but _assigned is not, so the two block contexts disagree inside comprehensions."  # 721b
