  clock: 7  # 0c28
  nonce: 0c28  # 0c28
  message: "Field limb FIXED by WI-bufud, PR #1854 (dev e45b60e109): on merged dev the b2 wrong edge (Other.ping @0.85) now lands on Conn.ping, and the a1/a4/a6 comprehension and lambda cases recover Conn.ping @0.85 (were external @0.4). STAYS VIOLATED on the remaining limb, re-run on merged dev with the dj2 fixture: def g(events): label = Order.LABELS.get('a'); return [label.payment_set.count() for label in events] -> python:external (refused) at line 6, while the same comprehension with no outer assignment (def h: [ev.payment_set.count() for ev in events]) -> python:django.db.models:0-0:count at line 10. Mechanism (unchanged): var_types is pruned at the comprehension boundary but the block's _assigned set is not, so the comprehension's own label is read as the outer, assigned-but-untyped label. Conservative (a lost edge, never a wrong one)."  # 0c28
